  "change_details": [
    "Actor Scout; task independent fifteen-minute canonical protocol and journal encoding correctness repair. Shared source applies where these protocol and journal helpers are used; each PC retains its scientific recipe and private operating bindings.",
    "Normalize ordinary builtin JSON trees with one complete strict walk, then serialize the validated tree once for bounded private canonical bytes. Every custom Mapping retains the original serializer path, including nested custom objects, key rules, errors, Unicode and size/depth bounds.",
    "Journal encoding consumes the fully validated canonical bytes directly, removing an unused SHA and second JSON serialization. Public canonical_sha256 and journal _checked_json function bytes remain identical; complete history, identity, event, lifecycle, transaction and idempotency checks remain intact.",
    "Preserve integrated empty-native UTC and inventory repairs, exact native sender, original freshness fixture phases, periodic known-order recovery, original probabilities/directions and local model recipes.",
    "Portable public tests use synthetic fixtures and frozen original function oracles. Authentic stored payload comparisons and full-audit profiling remain private; their historical results do not replace fresh source, isolated or main checks.",
    "Run seventeen complete canonical modules across four fresh commands, binding the complete dependency closure and every imported application or fixture byte. Cover strict protocol/custom mappings, canonical wire bytes, corruption/full audits, books inventory, known-order and UNKNOWN recovery, manual expiry/freshness controls and exact stock policy."
  ],
